{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maids of Storm\u00a0</strong>is a tycoon simulation game where you manage your very own maid caf\u00e9!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With charming pixel art, lovable maids, and engaging caf\u00e9 management mechanics, you\u2019ll experience both the joys and challenges of running a bustling caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a variety of story episodes, compete in business battles to boost your caf\u00e9\u2019s popularity, and have fun with quirky mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature 1: The Annual Maid Championship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020880/extras/ffd883918ec898cd32982d34038d1ad0.avif?t=1768649720\" width=1240 height=822 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Argent, the eternal underdog, finally rise to the top and win the prestigious Maid Championship to become the best caf\u00e9 around?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 Serve customers with a wide range of recipes and \ud83c\udfa8 customize your caf\u00e9\u2019s interior to make it truly unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020880/extras/3c969732c4a40a15d30eb313098400fe.poster.avif?t=1768649720\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020880/extras/3c969732c4a40a15d30eb313098400fe.webm?t=1768649720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020880/extras/3c969732c4a40a15d30eb313098400fe.mp4?t=1768649720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020880/extras/96504d59bf53465abc5c3af2e9d321aa.poster.avif?t=1768649720\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020880/extras/96504d59bf53465abc5c3af2e9d321aa.webm?t=1768649720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020880/extras/96504d59bf53465abc5c3af2e9d321aa.mp4?t=1768649720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature 2: Adorable Pixel Maids with Unique Personalities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of pixel-perfect maids is waiting to meet you.<br>Surely, one of them will become your \u2728favorite\u2728!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020880/extras/9dde523cd5f3eea554beeb290ea92748.avif?t=1768649720\" width=1240 height=664 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Increase efficiency with powerful <strong>Leader Skills</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020880/extras/729eececaa911e524e5a5a7a7b0c715b.poster.avif?t=1768649720\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020880/extras/729eececaa911e524e5a5a7a7b0c715b.webm?t=1768649720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020880/extras/729eececaa911e524e5a5a7a7b0c715b.mp4?t=1768649720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa Unlock hidden potential through <strong>maid training</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl